{"title":"Career roadmap · Airline Finance Associate","role":"Airline Finance Associate","summary":"An Airline Finance Associate supports the financial and commercial operations of an airline. The role can involve revenue accounting, ticket and passenger reconciliation, airport/vendor payments, budgeting, cost analysis, financial reporting, revenue management support, and aviation-specific financial analytics.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Aviation","Accounting","Airline Revenue & Costing","Excel","ERP","Financial Analysis","SQL/Power BI","Aviation Operations Knowledge","Internship"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Airline Finance Associate"},{"text":"Finance operations and reporting"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Revenue Accounting Associate"},{"text":"Ticket/revenue reconciliation"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Finance Executive – Aviation"},{"text":"Airline finance operations"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Commercial Finance Associate"},{"text":"Revenue and cost analysis"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Airport Finance Associate"},{"text":"Airport financial operations"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Airline Finance Analyst"},{"text":"Financial and operational analysis"}],[{"text":"3–6 Years"},{"text":"Revenue Accounting Analyst"},{"text":"Revenue recognition/reconciliation"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Commercial Finance Analyst"},{"text":"Route/product profitability"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Airline Finance Manager"},{"text":"Finance and business partnering"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Commercial Finance Manager"},{"text":"Revenue/cost strategy"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Head of Finance / Airline CFO Track"},{"text":"Strategic financial leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce + Aviation Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business statistics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Business law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aviation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airline business models"},{"text":"Airport operations"},{"text":"Passenger journey"},{"text":"Aircraft operations"},{"text":"Ground handling"},{"text":"Cargo"},{"text":"Ticketing"},{"text":"Distribution channels"},{"text":"Airline schedules"},{"text":"Route networks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Airline revenue concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fare"},{"text":"Base fare"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Fees"},{"text":"Ancillaries"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"Reissues"},{"text":"Cancellations"},{"text":"No-shows"},{"text":"Revenue leakage"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Airline Financial Basics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger volume"},{"text":"Ticket revenue"},{"text":"Ancillary revenue"},{"text":"Operating costs"},{"text":"Revenue per passenger"},{"text":"Profitability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Airline Accounting + Revenue Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Airline revenue accounting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Booking","Ticket Issuance","Travel","Revenue Recognition","Settlement","Reconciliation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Passenger ticket revenue"},{"text":"Ancillary revenue"},{"text":"Refunds"},{"text":"Reissues"},{"text":"Interline transactions"},{"text":"Agency sales"},{"text":"Unused tickets"},{"text":"Travel-related liabilit